> >--- Robin Lee Powell <rlpowell@digitalkingdom.org> wrote:
> > > Before changing the help and asking people to change their
> > > definitions, I'd like to see what people on the list think.  Do
> > > you prefer one over the other?  If you prefer the second form,
> > > should "x_1" always be used, or the first letter of the lujvo, or
> > > a series of letters representing the lujvo ("bd_1" in the case of
> > > ba'urdu'u) ?
> >
> >My preference is to only use x_1, x_2, etc. The other info is useful
